  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
</prov:Activity>

<prov:Activity rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#GenerationActivity">
  <rdfs:label>Ontology generation by OntoGeneration Agent (step 4)</rdfs:label>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#IdentifiedTerms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#ProposedAxioms"/>
  <prov:used rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#ProposedTests"/>
  <prov:generated rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine#"/>
  <prov:wasInformedBy rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#TestGenerationActivity"/>
  <prov:wasAssociatedWith rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#agent_OntoGeneration_Agent"/>
  <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
  <prov:hadPlan rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#GenerationPrompt"/>
  <prov:qualifiedAssociation>
    <prov:Association>
      <prov:agent rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#agent_OntoGeneration_Agent"/>
      <prov:hadRole rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/wine_prov#GeneratorRole"/>
    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models the eight supplied classes, seven object properties, one datatype property, and five named individuals exactly as specified. Domain and range constraints are materialized as axioms on each property to satisfy the Themis tests. Individuals are declared with InstanceOf pointing to their respective classes. No extra classes or superclasses are coined, respecting the closed class list constraint.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

